app ui-pirate-board "1.0.0"
"PirateBoard — isometric naval combat, port trading, exploration bounties, and cannon upgrades."
;; @capabilities "isometric naval combat, port trading, exploration bounty quests, cannon upgrade progression"

;; ============================================================================
;; PERSONA + USER STORIES
;;
;; Read these before changing anything here, and walk them end to end after.
;; One persona: the PLAYER, a pirate captain commanding the galleon on an
;; 8x8 isometric sea against a corsair, with a neutral scout on the water.
;; Statuses verified 2026-07-31 (Gate 4 catalog playthrough) through the
;; real runtime: standalone playground + embed-iframe verification bridge
;; (sendEvent/DOM clicks in, drawables/HUD DOM/eventLog out), one screenshot
;; per story in docs/runtime-verification-screenshots/gate4-ui-pirate-board/.
;; All 20 CDN svgs return 200 and paint live (zero 404s, assetStatus all
;; loaded). Two fixes landed in this pass: the enemy tick no longer queues
;; an explosion when no enemy is in range (it appended one unconditionally),
;; and the explosion svg joined the warm layer so the first broadside of a
;; session paints inside its ttl window. Substrate note: under fast scripted
;; driving the playground's server mirror lags, and its stale render-ui push
;; can overwrite the client's game-over overlay ~1s after the kill — the
;; client machine itself is unaffected (frozen checks pass on client-side
;; traces).
;;
;; THE GENRE (what a naval-tactics player expects): the sea is the board and
;; positioning is the game — you read the water, sail each ship inside its
;; reach, and commit to a broadside when an enemy hull drifts into firing
;; range. Gold is the economy: ports pay trade goods when you dock (once per
;; port per turn), uncharted islands pay an exploration bounty the first
;; time you sail alongside, and 50 gold refits your cannons for +1 firing
;; range. Every End Turn hands the sea to the corsair AI, which closes the
;; distance and punishes an exposed hull. You win by sinking every enemy
;; ship; you lose by being sunk. A round looks like: click your galleon ->
;; green sea cells inside sailing reach -> click a lit cell to sail (the
;; ship STAYS selected so it can fire) -> click an enemy inside firing
;; range for -3 hull, explosion burst, the ship is SPENT (dims, cannot act
;; again this turn) -> End Turn -> each living enemy in range 3 of a player
;; hull fires for -2, the rest sail 1 cell toward the nearest player hull
;; -> repeat. Each ship may sail ONCE and act ONCE per turn (movedIds /
;; actedIds track the activation; End Turn resets both; docking at a port
;; spends the whole activation).
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; PLAYER — "I sail my galleon, trade at ports, and sink the corsair before
;; she sinks me."
;;
;;   1. I open the board and see the whole sea framed on screen — water
;;      under every cell, islands breaking it up, a port and a treasure
;;      wreck as features, my galleon + the corsair + a neutral scout each
;;      with a name label and a health bar, and the HUD reading
;;      Gold / Turn / Ships.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). Boot paints 64 full-cell isometric tiles, 2
;;        ground-anchored features (port (4,1), treasure (5,5)), 3 ships
;;        with black+green health bars (u2 bar 0.4 = 8/10) and name
;;        labels, HUD Gold 0 / Turn 0 / Ships 1, 13 assets loaded, zero
;;        404s. Evidence: story-1-boot-sea-hud.png + drawables +
;;        assetStatus + page response listener.
;;   2. Every ship on the board is a visible sprite idling on a 4-frame
;;      breathing cycle, anchored to its cell.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). Unit layer url-rewrites ship.svg ->
;;        ship.<state>-<i>.svg on the renderTick counter (idle =
;;        floor(counter/3)%4 = 300ms/frame breathing, walk = counter%2,
;;        attack/hit/death = frame 0), anchor "ground". Live: idle frame
;;        advanced (idle-3 -> idle-1) across an 800ms sample; 28 warm
;;        sprites (27 unit frames + explosion) preload everything;
;;        attack-0/hit/death-0 frames observed in drawables during
;;        broadsides/sinks. Evidence: story-2-idle-breathing-sprites.png.
;;   3. I click MY galleon and the sea cells she can reach light up green.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). UNIT_CLICK u1 fired: selectedShipId set, phase
;;        "movement", 10 green cells lit (range-2 manhattan diamond minus
;;        the island block and occupied cells) + selection ellipse at
;;        (1,4). Guard: player team, hull > 0, not in actedIds.
;;        Evidence: story-3-select-galleon-green-cells.png + drawables.
;;   4. I click a lit cell and the galleon sails there — and stays
;;      selected, so she can fire immediately.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). TILE_CLICK (2,4) moved u1 (walk frame), kept
;;        selectedShipId (ellipse followed), phase "action", and paid
;;        the +5g island bounty (Gold 0 -> 5); a second bounty cell
;;        (3,4) paid again (5 -> 10). The move is SPENT: a second
;;        TILE_CLICK this turn was rejected (no transition, position
;;        unchanged). Island cells are not sailable: (2,3) rejected on
;;        a fresh ship. Evidence: story-4-sail-bounty-stays-selected.png.
;;   5. I click an enemy inside firing range and she takes a broadside;
;;      my ship is then spent for the turn.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). With u1 at (3,4) and the corsair at (5,3),
;;        UNIT_CLICK u2 fired: -3 hull (bar 0.4 -> 0.25), attacker
;;        joined actedIds + movedIds and dimmed (opacity 0.45),
;;        explosion descriptor queued at the target with the correct
;;        asset/ttl (visible burst proven on the enemy's reply fire,
;;        story-8b-enemy-fires-back.png), attack-0 frame in drawables.
;;        The repeat click was rejected (bar unchanged). Evidence:
;;        story-5-broadside-explosion.png + probe drawables.
;;   6. I dock at an untraded port: the port pays trade goods and my
;;      ship's activation is over.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). TILE_CLICK (4,1) with u1 at (4,3) fired: paid
;;        20g + half current hull (floor(6/2) = 3) — HUD Gold 15 -> 38 —
;;        marked the port traded until End Turn, spent the ship
;;        (movedIds + actedIds, dimmed, selection cleared).
;;        Evidence: story-6-port-trade-goods.png.
;;   7. I change my mind mid-selection and back out cleanly.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). Re-clicking the selected ship collapsed the
;;        green cells while keeping the selection ellipse (phase
;;        "action"); CANCEL then cleared selection + highlights (phase
;;        "observation"); a second CANCEL with no selection fired no
;;        transition (guard fail). Evidence: story-7-cancel-clean.png.
;;   8. I end my turn and the corsair takes hers — she closes in and
;;      fights back, and my ship is fresh again.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). End Turn button: Turn 0 -> 1, enemyAiTick
;;        stepped the corsair (6,2) -> (5,3) toward u1; once within 3
;;        it fired -2 per turn (u1 bar 0.5 -> 0.4 -> 0.3 -> 0.2 across
;;        turns) with a visible explosion burst on the hit
;;        (story-8b-enemy-fires-back.png); u1 could act again each
;;        following turn (fresh movedIds/actedIds). LIMITATION: enemy
;;        steps POP to their new cell — the single anim slot is
;;        player-facing (same as ui-battle-board).
;;   9. I bank gold and refit my cannons: 50 gold buys +1 firing range.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). Buy Cannons button rejected at 38g (no
;;        transition, gold unchanged); COLLECT_GOLD +50 fired
;;        (unguarded, 38 -> 88); the button then fired (88 -> 38).
;;        Range proof from the same cells: a manhattan-4 shot at the
;;        corsair was rejected at firingRange 3 (bar unchanged), then
;;        FIRED after the refit (bar 0.4 -> 0.25). Evidence:
;;        story-9-cannons-range-4-shot.png.
;;  10. When the last enemy sinks, I win and the game tells me — Play
;;      Again resets the sea. When my fleet sinks, I lose.
;;        PASS (Gate 4). The killing blow fired GAME_END -> gameover:
;;        VICTORY game-menu overlay + Play Again button (traitState
;;        gameover), and the board was frozen — an End Turn click
;;        produced zero new client-side transitions. Play Again reset
;;        the sea (Gold 0 / Turn 0 / Ships 1, ships back at start
;;        cells, corsair bar 0.4, traitState playing). DEFEAT path:
;;        parked galleon, 7 End Turns — the corsair closed (6,2) ->
;;        (4,4), fired -2/turn (bar 0.5 -> 0.1, death-0 frame), DEFEAT
;;        overlay, Ships HUD 0. Evidence: story-10-victory-overlay.png,
;;        story-10-play-again-reset.png, story-10-defeat-overlay.png.
;;
;; ASSET INVENTORY (hand-authored svg, almadar-kflow-assets.web.app
;; /shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/, generated by tools/asset-workflow
;; svg-generator from the sibling .md descriptions)
;;
;;   Terrain   terrain/{sea,island}.svg — full-cell isometric cubes drawn
;;             at width/height 1 (no gaps at render).
;;   Units     units/ship.svg + .{idle-0..3, walk-0..1, attack-0, hit-0,
;;             death-0}.svg frames; the unit layer url-rewrites
;;             ship.svg -> ship.<state>-<i>.svg (idle = 4-frame breathing
;;             at 300ms/frame, walk = 2 frames at 100ms, attack/hit/death =
;;             frame 0), anchor "ground". player: u1 Galleon 10hp (1,4);
;;             enemy: u2 Corsair 8hp (6,2); neutral: u3 Scout 6hp (4,0).
;;   Features  features/{port,treasure}.svg — anchor "ground", 1x1.
;;   Effects   effects/explosion.svg — broadside burst at the target cell
;;             (ttl 9 decayed by fxDecayTick), anchor "center".
;;   UI chrome ui/panel-frame.svg (shell + HUD background),
;;             ui/icon-{gold,turn,ships,cannon}.svg (HUD stats + buttons).
;; ============================================================================
orbital PirateBoardOrbital {

  type PirateBoardError = {
    message : string!
    name : string
    code : string
    stack : string
  }
  type Asset = {
      url : asset
      atlas : asset
      sprite : string
      role : string
      category : string
      animations : [string]
      style : string
      variant : string
      dimension : string
      aspect : string
      name : string
      thumbnailUrl : string
    }
  type PirateBoardTilesItem = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    terrain : string
    type : string
    terrainSprite : Asset
    passable : boolean
    movementCost : number
    tileType : string
    elevation : number
    modelUrl : Asset
  }
  type PirateBoardUnitsItem = {
    id : string!
    position : PirateBoardUnitsItemPosition
    x : number
    y : number
    z : number
    sprite : Asset
    modelUrl : Asset
    unitType : string
    heroId : string
    name : string
    team : "player" | "enemy" | "neutral"
    faction : "player" | "enemy" | "neutral"
    health : number
    maxHealth : number
    traits : [PirateBoardUnitsItemTraitsItem]
    previousPosition : PirateBoardUnitsItemPreviousPosition
    elevation : number
    animation : string
    frame : number
  }
  type PirateBoardEffectItem = {
    key : string!
    x : number!
    y : number!
    ttl : number!
  }
  type PirateBoardUnitsItemPosition = {
    x : number!
    y : number!
  }
  type PirateBoardUnitsItemTraitsItem = {
    name : string!
    currentState : string!
    states : [string]!
    cooldown : number!
  }
  type PirateBoardUnitsItemPreviousPosition = {
    x : number!
    y : number!
  }
  type PirateBoardFeaturesItem = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    type : string!
    sprite : Asset
    assetUrl : Asset
    color : string
    elevation : number
  }
  type PirateBoardAssetManifest = {
    terrains : Map string Asset
    units : Map string Asset
    features : Map string Asset
    effects : Map string Asset
  }
  type PirateBoardMoveTo = {
    x : number!
    y : number!
  }

  entity PirateBoardItem [runtime] {
    id : string!
    ships : [PirateBoardUnitsItem]
    selectedShipId : string
    validMoves : [PirateBoardUnitsItemPosition] = []
    turn : number = 0
    gold : number = 0
    result : "none" | "victory" | "defeat" = none
    phase : string = "observation"
    gridWidth : number = 8
    gridHeight : number = 8
    movementRange : number = 2
    firingRange : number = 3
    enemyTurn : boolean = false
    effects : [PirateBoardEffectItem] = []
    tradedPorts : [string] = []
    visited : [string] = []
    animCounter : number = 0
    animUnitId : string = ""
    animState : string = "idle"
    animTicksLeft : number = 0
    animAttackerId : string = ""
    animAtkTicksLeft : number = 0
    movedIds : [string] = []
    actedIds : [string] = []
  }

  trait PirateBoardRender -> @rebindable PirateBoardItem [interaction, instance] {
    initial: playing

state playing {
      INIT -> playing
        (set @entity.ships @config.units)
        (set @entity.selectedShipId "")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (set @entity.turn 0)
        (set @entity.gold 0)
        (set @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.phase "observation")
        (set @entity.enemyTurn false)
        (set @entity.effects [])
        (set @entity.tradedPorts [])
        (set @entity.visited [])
        (set @entity.movedIds [])
        (set @entity.actedIds [])
        (set @entity.animCounter 0)
        (set @entity.animUnitId "")
        (set @entity.animState "idle")
        (set @entity.animTicksLeft 0)
        (set @entity.animAttackerId "")
        (set @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 0)
        (set @entity.gridWidth 8)
        (set @entity.gridHeight 8)
        (set @entity.movementRange 2)
        (set @entity.firingRange 3)
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Turn", value: @entity.turn, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-turn.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-turn", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Ships", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.ships (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.health 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-ships.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-ships", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          addons: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: sm, children: [ { type: button, action: END_TURN, label: "End Turn", iconAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-turn.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-turn", thumbnailUrl: "" }, variant: secondary }, { type: button, action: BUY_CANNONS, label: "Buy Cannons", iconAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-cannon.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-cannon", thumbnailUrl: "" }, variant: primary } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite), anchor: "center", width: 1, height: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.ships (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedShipId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.ships (fn u (let ((unitAsset (if (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) (object/get @u modelUrl) (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest units) (object/get @u unitType)))) (unitUrl (object/get @unitAsset url)) (unitAnim (if (<= (object/get @u health) 0) "death" (if (and (== (object/get @u id) @entity.animAttackerId) (> @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 0)) "attack" (if (== (object/get @u id) @entity.animUnitId) @entity.animState "idle"))))) { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), asset: (if (and @unitUrl (str/includes @unitUrl ".svg")) (object/merge @unitAsset { url: (str/concat (array/nth (str/split @unitUrl ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat @unitAnim (str/concat "-" (str/concat (if (== @unitAnim "walk") (% @entity.animCounter 2) (if (== @unitAnim "idle") (% (math/floor (/ @entity.animCounter 3)) 4) 0))) ".svg")))) }) @unitAsset), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "ground", width: 0.5, height: 0.5, opacity: (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.actedIds (fn aid (== @aid (object/get @u id))))) 0) 0.45 1) }))) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/append (array/map (array/filter (array/flatten (array/map @entity.ships (fn u (array/flatten (array/map [ ["idle", 4], ["walk", 2], ["attack", 1], ["hit", 1], ["death", 1] ] (fn st (array/map (array/range 0 (array/nth @st 1)) (fn i (if (and (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) (str/includes (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg")) (str/concat (array/nth (str/split (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat (array/nth @st 0) (str/concat "-" (str/concat @i ".svg"))))) ""))))))))) (fn w (!= @w ""))) (fn warmUrl { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: 0, y: 0 }, asset: { url: @warmUrl }, opacity: 0, width: 0.5, height: 0.5 })) { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: 0, y: 0 }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) "explosion"), opacity: 0, width: 0.5, height: 0.5 }) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.ships (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), anchor: "ground", offsetX: -0.25, offsetY: -0.6, width: 0.5, height: 0.12, fill: "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.ships (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), anchor: "ground", offsetX: -0.25, offsetY: -0.6, width: (* 0.5 (/ (object/get @u health) (object/get @u maxHealth))), height: 0.12, fill: "#22c55e" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.ships (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.effects (fn e { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @e x), y: (object/get @e y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @e key)), anchor: "center", width: 0.8, height: 0.8 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
          ] } ]
        })

      UNIT_CLICK -> playing when (and (== @entity.selectedShipId ?unitId) (== (object/get (array/find @entity.ships (fn u (== @u.id ?unitId))) team) "player"))
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (set @entity.phase "action")
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Gold", value: @entity.gold, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-gold.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-gold", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Turn", value: @entity.turn, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-turn.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-turn", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Ships", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.ships (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.health 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-ships.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-ships", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          addons: { type: stack, direction: horizontal, gap: sm, children: [ { type: button, action: END_TURN, label: "End Turn", iconAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-turn.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-turn", thumbnailUrl: "" }, variant: secondary }, { type: button, action: BUY_CANNONS, label: "Buy Cannons", iconAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-pirate-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-cannon.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-cannon", thumbnailUrl: "" }, variant: primary } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite), anchor: "center", width: 1, height: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.ships (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedShipId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
